# Every text file is stored AND checked out with LF endings, on every OS.
# The repo's blobs are already all-LF; pinning checkout prevents windows-latest
# runners (where core.autocrlf=true is the image default) from materializing
# CRLF working trees, which broke `dotnet format --verify-no-changes` and
# newline-exact tool output tests - both only on CI, never locally.
* text=auto eol=lf
